                                "contextRegion": {
                                    "startLine": 49,
                                    "endLine": 54,
                                    "snippet": {
                                        "text": "    <string name=\"final_copy_65\">Full-screen recording may include the current page, other apps and notifications. Switching apps or tabs changes the image. Hide sensitive content and confirm your right to record.</string>\n    <string name=\"final_copy_66\">Advanced recording requests the full default display. Check the system consent scope; some devices may override the request. Dimensions cannot confirm app or content identity. Single-app regional capture is not guaranteed.</string>\n    <string name=\"final_copy_67\">Choose the scope on the system consent page. Unverifiable scope is shown as unknown. A single app may be selected when supported. Hidden tabs and background pages are not guaranteed to be captured.</string>\n    <string name=\"final_copy_68\">The full system capture briefly passes through memory/GPU. Only the confirmed region is encoded to private segments. No temporary full-screen file is saved and crop failure does not fall back to full-screen output.</string>\n    <string name=\"final_copy_69\">Proportional selection defines coordinates only; it is not bound to an app, page or earlier screen. The later system-authorized frame is cropped to those coordinates. Check the consent scope.</string>\n"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "fixes": [
                    ],
                    "partialFingerprints": {
                        "sourceContext/v1": "777ff05d48fbec6e"
                    }
