                                    "startLine": 99,
                                    "endLine": 104,
                                    "snippet": {
                                        "text": "    <string name=\"flow_savetaskscreen_23\">Candidates may be advertisements or other clips. Check before selecting. Page-declared quality and duration are still verified locally before saving.</string>\n    <string name=\"flow_savetaskscreen_24\">Compatible MP4 download is free; HLS requires streaming access. Select a fixed quality after manifest inspection. Short-lived cookies go only to the original same-origin resource, never redirected or child resources.</string>\n    <string name=\"flow_savetaskscreen_25\">Cancel</string>\n    <string name=\"flow_savetaskscreen_26\">Choose a fixed HLS resource</string>\n    <string name=\"flow_savetaskscreen_27\">Only unencrypted static TS VOD, AVC Baseline and optional AAC-LC are supported. Declared quality still needs media verification. No automatic quality switching or transcoding.</string>\n"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
